<title>SWITZERLAND: Kuoni H1 net more than doubles.</title>
<headline>Kuoni H1 net more than doubles.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			33.0		vs 13.8</p>
<p> Gross sales		    1,907.3	   vs 1,520.7</p>
<p> Gross profit		   268.7	     vs 207.8</p>
<p> Op profit before goodwill  24.1		vs 8.5</p>
<p> Goodwill			 0.6		 vs 0</p>
<p> Op profit (EBIT)	     23.5		vs 8.5</p>
<p> Financial result	     19.8		vs 15.9</p>
<p> Financial expense	    1.5		 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Taxes			    7.9		 vs 10.6</p>
<p> Net profit before min	33.9		vs 13.1</p>
<p> Minorities		     0.9		 vs 0.7</p>
<p> Net profit per share (Sfr) 103		 vs 43</p>
<p>NOTE - Swiss travel and tour operator Kuoni Reisen Holding AG is active mainly in Europe, Britain and Asian emerging markets. Kunoi said currency factors caused by a weaker Swiss franc contributed 39.5 percent out of net profit growth of 139.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
